  "releaseNotes": "- **Update Timezone Data and Comments**.\n- Updated the TZ Database version reference from `2025b` to `2026c`.\n- Corrected and standardized comments for timezone attributes.\n- Improved descriptions for regions and countries in timezone attributes (e.g., `Côte d'Ivoire` to `Côte d’Ivoire`).",
